• You can easily adjust the brightness, saturation and contrast of the photos;
• You can adjust your photos through functions such as cropping and rotating;
• You can draw, add text, and create your favorite paintings or graffiti photos;
• You can also easily share the beautified and created photos to all social platforms and share them with your family and friends.

